the full isp module binary set from the current internal build:
libisp/libisp_algo/libteaisp/libcvi_ispd2/libisp_ipc_client, 3A (ae/af/awb),
raw (raw_dump/raw_replay/raw_replay_offline). pre-image = v1 (post-0049/0060).

